            "review_title": "Review at Schulz Beer Brewery Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Owee\nNha Trang, Vietnam7621 contributions\n0\nGreat location. Good value and\nSep 2018\nI never tried the food so cannot comment though the menu looked ok. Tried all the beers offered. I noticed all beers not clear. Seemed a bit yeasty and green to me, however, perhaps this is the new way. Fillable plastic bottles to go. Prices good for what you get. I would have given a higher rating if beer was perhaps settled in the 2nd stage longer. I will return and try again. The location is perfect and needed in the newer tourist area on the north end of Nha Trang.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2018",
